      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Springs%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Three Springs sits at the foot of Jacks Mountain, where Spring Creek and North Spring Branch merge into Three Springs Creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Springs%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pennsylvania Route 994 runs through the center of Three Springs, linking it northeast to Rockhill and west-northwest to Entriken.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
