      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Springs%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Three Springs Historical Society acquired its Hudson Street building eleven years ago, turning it into a community hub for history and research.",
